ndrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FRF1bSp1bA4W5fy6cKkunFpwoX1rCMzQogCRM6sWJCx8SPV50DDBVml3MnS3WkYAx2HuR1T9bPNsOvXoCYCErichicB2XnzllGicFlsmFsXaCb8%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-05-15T05:48:51.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg2MTk4MDM1Mg%3D%3D:2247485669:1","title":"企业级 All-In-One 平台「DSPHERE-INTERNAL」正式开源","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg2MTk4MDM1Mg==&mid=2247485669&idx=1&sn=af27f61b4e5c24c20c15a4a0c87cafcd&chksm=cf1e51611a2dce5bca926f94a4962d0c90ed9a7a121149cb3af1a09d571adce6b9c0569ed76e&scene=126&sessionid=1795563417#rd","description":"INTERNAL 是一套面向企业内部办公的平台，不同于主流媒体惯用的日日颠覆、天天炸场的叙事方式，这里没有什么","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FRF1bSp1bA4VNwkX47S04VfE0Sg5T9k8EqPDmBp2VX3QvxzwdMl6vQVsr4j945hSbMTbH7o2XgaHCxoRmUico4xDqY9Z5XFGCmeT28SsoCickM%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-05-11T05:08:02.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg2MTk4MDM1Mg%3D%3D:2247485588:1","title":"快 10 年没写过代码，花了 7 天时间，用 AI 从头构建了一整套企业办公系统","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg2MTk4MDM1Mg==&mid=2247485588&idx=1&sn=cc1414ca5f7a8afd9cba9b8fb621a6f8&chksm=cf01a73a59973b7200373dd9254344193b3d564ab020c8c5f6f18c5ce85c31c59bf39e664fb5&scene=126&sessionid=1795563417#rd","description":"普通人，即非研发背景的大众，是否可以依赖 AI 编程去开发系统和工具？我的答案是，几乎不可能。任何沉醉于社交媒体的习惯，都是不建议的。随着系统复杂度的提升，会越来越需要程序员的专业能力，去排错、调试和指导 AI 编写代码，越到后面越是寸步难行。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FaT6NCM5CI8Ku6VvPR123FibkVL3mLl8IGubnLfukibl22NZzaicmnIjw9mAq5WP5ooSLoUygUE2iaX1YBVetUmct8A%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-01-29T11:27:31.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg2MTk4MDM1Mg%3D%3D:2247485571:1","title":"企业安全浏览器 (SEB) 白皮书","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg2MTk4MDM1Mg==&mid=2247485571&idx=1&sn=3f7de5fbc60dee8bfb7543b5786fe732&chksm=cf10f940c314110df288a56c5253553c5907645fe453fd8544a4cc2241e0ea221e4428219b8a&scene=126&sessionid=1795563417#rd","description":"■ 主要依赖 SaaS 应用程序、且需要保护的分支机构或网络物理系统（CPS）较少的企业，需要比传统安全堆栈","image":"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_jpg/XzYibP7l9MpqicNTPP18kMfCJxOfZD50l0QZZ0uTG0wOdKzhIXxLibSNGpad7FA9fERWrD1ibqXMStY8sn4Qd7OGgA/640?wxtype=jpeg&wxfrom=25","type":"article","published":"2026-01-13T05:58:46.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg2MTk4MDM1Mg%3D%3D:2247485552:1","title":"中国网络安全市场的“三元结构”","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg2MTk4MDM1Mg==&mid=2247485552&idx=1&sn=e204093a3d6f9c163b60010b696dce97&chksm=cfccdce64d9c887a3180df86b207832591cde1364a4d2440df9029d51340035a48436dc03b8c&scene=126&sessionid=1795563417#rd","description":"作为创业者，不要试图教育市场，而要适配结构。创业初期，你必须做出选择，要么你的技术是源自最前沿的“民营实战”；要么，你的商业模式必须懂得如何在该“国企合规”的土壤中落地。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FaT6NCM5CI8IjMbLjp1Wia1ibnkicoqzMPo9kJG7po7ibf3IdXe1HsicicjVchPaCcq0LVaOmUOAGjluSaTgMQeICpr7Q%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-01-08T03:06:20.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg2MTk4MDM1Mg%3D%3D:2247485547:1","title":"美国视角，观察中国 2025 数据安全行业（合规体制下大型企业与中小企业的比较）","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg2MTk4MDM1Mg==&mid=2247485547&idx=1&sn=9288c141636139ccf7bd6e6d41af2e85&chksm=cfeff11c60910a07392c283552cc9842a18dc3c7e4524e07c6580b32aea2a53930a040dd6f7e&scene=126&sessionid=1795563417#rd","description":"在 2025 年的中国，通用的安全产品已经失效。如果你做大客户，你必须是信创、国密，且重服务的。如果你做小客户，你必须是极低成本且高度自动的。最危险的厂商是那些卡在中间的，既不够高端以进入国企的“信创白名单”，又不够便宜以打动中小企业的心。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FaT6NCM5CI8LrWhwftqarwLUxhgR1lXpLEpwCncWJk7TEibcqaxbM0TtrCDnk6fOF6vGMJ5kSfMo8sqNqiarrKhUQ%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-01-05T02:14:19.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg2MTk4MDM1Mg%3D%3D:2247485530:1","title":"中美网络安全特色对比，与发展方向浅谈","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg2MTk4MDM1Mg==&mid=2247485530&idx=1&sn=7f63fe63996837a74ecb9830ae4efbe6&chksm=cff968acfc5d753cbe2e5c027e4cc159bad8457f6c2219986b22b185956ec43e2c28a9f1cdc2&scene=126&sessionid=1795563417#rd","description":"视频内容由 Gemini 依据我过往零散公众号文章内容生成，不足之处是 AI 用了一些“绝对”的词汇，但其串联散点内容的能力确实很强，视频内容整体还是不错的。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FaT6NCM5CI8KYibibwDTYf8XTIeAtk6Upq7ic1fBkmjxkCB0aL2lhvib5t4xIQnFMe1WAGiad41CqUOFtNkJradbnblQ%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-01-01T09:42:26.000Z"}]}